  <!-- EN: perfect prison cell -->
  <RV2World_VoreblesserUltimatePrisonCell.label>完美囚笼</RV2World_VoreblesserUltimatePrisonCell.label>
  <!-- EN: Open a permanent psychic holding space: vore capacity becomes effectively unlimited, vore encumbrance is practically ignored, non-lethal prey feed from the void instead of draining the predator's food, digestion is halved, and prey cannot be ejected or transferred during sex. Applying the buff puts the caster and target into a one-day coma. Casting it again on the same pawn dismisses the buff without another coma. -->
  <RV2World_VoreblesserUltimatePrisonCell.description>开启永久存在的灵能收容空间：吞噬容量近乎无限，吞噬负重几乎不再造成影响；非致命猎物从虚空获取食物，不会消耗捕食者的食物；消化时间减半；且无法在性交期间排出或转移猎物。施加此增益会使施法者和目标昏迷一天。再次对同一名小人施放即可解除增益，且不会再次昏迷。</RV2World_VoreblesserUltimatePrisonCell.description>
